{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Touch of Death",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The cleric can use Channel Divinity to destroy another creature's life force by touch.</p><p>When the cleric hits a creature with a weapon attack or deals necrotic damage to it with a spell, the cleric can use Channel Divinity to deal extra necrotic damage to the target. The damage equals 5 + twice his or her cleric level.</p>",
